{
  "_comment": "Paper-scale reference configuration (arXiv:2606.09186 Sec. 3-4): Qwen3-Omni-scale Thinker, Mimi codec, 480 ms slices, paper LRs. Not runnable in this repository - documents the target hyperparameters.",
